    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for stateful action nodes in the behavior tree. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides the foundation for creating ROS-integrated behavior tree nodes that maintain state between executions. It inherits from BT::StatefulActionNode and provides integration with ROS node handles. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
